From: OpenWrt Salt packaging
Subject: Avoid duplicate wheel scripts rejected by python-installer

Salt 3008.3 emits both console entry points and legacy .data/scripts with
the same filenames. OpenWrt's python-installer raises FileExistsError while
installing that wheel. Keep the console entry points and omit legacy copies.

--- a/setup.py
+++ b/setup.py
@@ -1019,7 +1019,7 @@
 
     @property
     def _property_scripts(self):
-        return salt_build_backend.get_scripts(self)
+        return []
 
     @property
     def _property_install_requires(self):
